{"id":"b83510f2f3818619","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-martingale-space.md","title":"鞅的空间引理","display":"thm-martingale-space — 鞅的空间引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-martingale-space","aliases":["43-thm-martingale-space"],"display":"thm-martingale-space — 鞅的空间引理","depends_on":["[[43-df-martingale]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.3 Lemma 11.3.1，印刷254，PDF274","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-martingale-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-martingale-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-martingale-space — 鞅的空间引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.3 Lemma 11.3.1，印刷254，PDF274"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是非负鞅（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\delta\\in\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta&gt;1\">\\(\\delta&gt;1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 为下式定义的延伸长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell:=\\left\\lceil\\log_2\\!\\left(\\frac{k}{1-\\delta^{-1}}\\right)\\right\\rceil.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell:=\\left\\lceil\\log_2\\!\\left(\\frac{k}{1-\\delta^{-1}}\\right)\\right\\rceil.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left|\\{\\tau\\in2^\\ell:d(\\sigma\\tau)\\le\\delta d(\\sigma)\\}\\right|\\ge k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left|\\{\\tau\\in2^\\ell:d(\\sigma\\tau)\\le\\delta d(\\sigma)\\}\\right|\\ge k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>长度ℓ的平均资本恰为d(σ)。资本&gt;δd(σ)的比例小于1/δ，余下至少k个。d(σ)=0时所有后继资本均0，结论也成立。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.3 Lemma 11.3.1，印刷254，PDF274。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d$ 是非负鞅（see [[43-df-martingale]]），$\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}$，$\\delta\\in\\mathbb Q$ 且 $\\delta>1$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\ell$ 为下式定义的延伸长度。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\in\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta>1","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell:=\\left\\lceil\\log_2\\!\\left(\\frac{k}{1-\\delta^{-1}}\\right)\\right\\rceil.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left|\\{\\tau\\in2^\\ell:d(\\sigma\\tau)\\le\\delta d(\\sigma)\\}\\right|\\ge k.","display":true}],"bytes":1174,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-martingale-space]] — 鞅的空间引理"}],"outgoing":["0038977b84ae1a9f"]}